{ You can also take on the Slav defense when playing the London System.

I will teach you how to beat this.
(Make the main movements) }
1. d4 d5 2. Bf4 c6 { This is the Slav defense in the London System
third move? } 3. e3 Bf5 { In the Slav defense the bishop goes to f5.
Play c4 } { [%csl Bf5][%cal Gc2c4] } 4. c4 e6 { Develop your knight } { [%csl Gb1] } 5. Nc3 { Very good!
Now the bishop is outside the pawn chain, you need to remember this to move on to the next chapter, since in the other it may be different. } { [%csl Gf5,Rf7,Re6,Rd5,Rc6,Rb7] } *

